      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 May et al.",
        "AbstractText": "We report the draft genome sequences of Aggregatibacter actinomycetemcomitans strains 310a (310-TR) and 310b (310-OS). Strain 310a is a clinical isolate with a rough phenotype. Strain 310b is a laboratory-adapted isolate derived from the passage of 310a and displays a smooth phenotype."
